# CYC widget look and feel

Match [commityourcode.com](https://www.commityourcode.com/). Tokens live in `widgets/src/index.css` as `--cyc-*`.

- Geist Sans for headings/body, Geist Mono for kickers (`01 / LABEL`), indexes, times
- Navy `#031227`, ink `#07152e`, accent `#0868f7`, cloud `#f5f8fc`, line `#dce5f0`, radius 8px
- Numbered speaker cards, hairline rules, track pills with a color dot
- Dark theme uses navy paper, not generic zinc
- No Inter, no purple gradients, no fake browser chrome
- Photos from the catalog (Contentful); fallback to initials on navy
